pieces!\n\nPlease consider drawing my character, Poppy! https://toyhou.se/20506451.poppy\n\nPoppy is a shapeshifting mimic monster that eats others of her kind, so while it might look like she eats humans, that's actually not the case! She typically disguises herself as a high-school girl but she also has a history of dressing extravagantly in her long past! She likes red and red things. She also has a \"cool beauty\" vibe as a human.\n\nIf you feel like it, you may draw other shapeshifting mimic monsters in the picture as well if you'd like to add to a creepy atmosphere but that's definitely up to you! And I would love either version of Poppy, whichever you feel like or that inspires you more!\n\nI trust your compositions so please draw freely!\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/20506451.poppy", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@25dPz/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2549381, "client_id": 2835866, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/60239368/uploads/origins/dca9341d-3092-48d5-a2aa-bdb737062143?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a8e80a5268e9ad4c7ecff84ba8c17d9a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/60239368/uploads/origins/dca9341d-3092-48d5-a2aa-bdb737062143?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a8e80a5268e9ad4c7ecff84ba8c17d9a, https://si.imgix.net/60239368/uploads/origins/dca9341d-3092-48d5-a2aa-bdb737062143?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87f1c9cf795cc9e48cc44bdf584ec1c2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/60239368/uploads/origins/dca9341d-3092-48d5-a2aa-bdb737062143?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a10dfddedeaa74db571a5383010e5b0e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix